        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Pisces &mdash; 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p><em>The white roses whose scent alone kills &mdash; Aphrodite's first garden.</em></p><p>A 20-foot burst fills with drifting white petals for 1 minute.</p><p>Any creature that starts its turn in the area must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> @Damage[3d8[poison]] damage and enfeebled 1.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and stupefied 2 for 1 minute &mdash; the scent takes the mind before the body.</p><p>Creatures with no sense of smell are unaffected.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
